    /// Fetch details for a specific portfolio by UUID
    /// </summary>
    /// <remarks>
    /// See <see href="https://docs.cdp.coinbase.com/api-reference/advanced-trade-api/rest-api/portfolios/get-portfolio-breakdown"/>  <br/>
